WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.904
Lampstand does not replace OBS.

2
00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:05.775
It feeds it.

3
00:00:05.875 --> 00:00:10.801
Add the lyrics to OBS as a browser source, with no plugin.

4
00:00:10.901 --> 00:00:16.127
Then Present shows whether OBS is connected, and whether you are streaming or recording.
